---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import blogImage from '../../assets/images/blog-articles.webp';
---
<BaseLayout title="Food Intolerance Blog - Tips & Evidence - FoodCheck" description="Evidence-based articles on food intolerance, elimination diets, FODMAPs, testing accuracy, and practical nutrition guides for managing digestive symptoms." breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Blog', href: '/blog' }]}">
<Header /><main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
<h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-4 tracking-tight">Blog</h1>
<p class="text-lg text-slate-500 mb-12 max-w-2xl">Evidence-based articles on food intolerance, nutrition, and digestive health.</p>
<Image src={blogImage} alt="Workspace with nutrition articles and healthy food references" class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl mb-10 max-w-2xl" width={800} height={450} loading="lazy" format="webp" />
<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-5">What Can You Learn From Our Articles?</h2>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
<a href="/blog/elimination-diet-guide" class="group bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all no-underline">
<span class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-600 bg-brand-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full mb-3 inline-block">Guide</span>
<h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-brand-700 transition-colors mb-1">Elimination Diet: A Step-by-Step Guide</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-slate-500">How to systematically identify trigger foods using a structured elimination and reintroduction protocol.</p>
</a>
<a href="/blog/low-fodmap-foods" class="group bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all no-underline">
<span class="text-xs font-medium text-amber-600 bg-amber-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full mb-3 inline-block">Nutrition</span>
<h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-brand-700 transition-colors mb-1">Low FODMAP Food List</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-slate-500">A comprehensive guide to high and low FODMAP foods to help manage IBS and food intolerances.</p>
</a>
<a href="/blog/are-food-intolerance-tests-accurate" class="group bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all no-underline">
<span class="text-xs font-medium text-red-600 bg-red-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full mb-3 inline-block">Evidence</span>
<h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-brand-700 transition-colors mb-1">Are Food Intolerance Tests Accurate?</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-slate-500">What the evidence says about IgG tests, breath tests, and other commercial testing methods.</p>
</a>
</div>

<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-12 mb-5">How Should You Use These Articles?</h2>
<p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">Our articles are written by a registered dietitian and reviewed against guidelines from the NHS, British Dietetic Association, and Monash University. Use them to:</p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-8">
  <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2">Prepare for Your GP Appointment</h3><p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Understand which tests are evidence-based so you can ask informed questions.</p></div>
  <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2">Start an Elimination Diet Safely</h3><p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Follow our step-by-step protocol to avoid common mistakes and nutritional gaps.</p></div>
  <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2">Understand Your Diet Options</h3><p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Compare approaches like low FODMAP, elimination diets, and breath test protocols.</p></div>
</div>

<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-12 mb-5">Where Should You Go Next?</h2>
<p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">After reading our articles, try our free tools to put what you have learned into practice:</p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-8">
  <a href="/" class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-brand-300 transition-colors no-underline"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2">Food Intolerance Checker</h3><p class="text-xs text-slate-500">3-step assessment to explore possible triggers</p></a>
  <a href="/tools/food-diary" class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-brand-300 transition-colors no-underline"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2">Food Diary</h3><p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Track meals and symptoms to spot patterns</p></a>
  <a href="/tools/elimination-diet-planner" class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-brand-300 transition-colors no-underline"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2">Elimination Diet Planner</h3><p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Structured template for elimination and reintroduction</p></a>
</div>
</main>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "ItemList",
  "name": "Food Intolerance Blog",
  "description": "Evidence-based articles on food intolerance and digestive health",
  "itemListElement": [
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Elimination Diet: A Step-by-Step Guide", "url": "https://foodintolerancecheck.com/blog/elimination-diet-guide" },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Low FODMAP Food List", "url": "https://foodintolerancecheck.com/blog/low-fodmap-foods" },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Are Food Intolerance Tests Accurate?", "url": "https://foodintolerancecheck.com/blog/are-food-intolerance-tests-accurate" }
  ]
}
</script>
<Footer /></BaseLayout>
